			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Remove trailing blank line after macro definition\n\nEliminate a redundant empty line following the `forward_to_cocoon!` macro definition in `WindServiceHandlers/mod.rs` to maintain consistent formatting within the IPC dispatch module.\n\nThis cleanup aligns with the recent refactoring efforts to localize dispatch macros and prepares the file structure for future macro extensions.",
